WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400
<v Nicolas Palma>Everyone, I'm here at the hotel, at the Experts Club event. I ran into a great client, friend and partner,

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:08.320
<v Nicolas Palma>Dr. Luiz Cruz, and he's going to talk a bit about the experience he's having here with MedGrowth.

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:16.020
<v Dr. Luiz Cruz>Well, I'm here, very pleased, with Nicolas, who has been my mentor at MedGrowth

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:21.280
<v Dr. Luiz Cruz>in my growth on social media, my growth, my development,

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:25.180
<v Dr. Luiz Cruz>on Meta, on Google, on Facebook, on Instagram.

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:28.040
<v Dr. Luiz Cruz>And it was a real differentiator, disruptive,

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:31.320
<v Dr. Luiz Cruz>when I entered the world of artificial intelligence,

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:33.220
<v Dr. Luiz Cruz>which really is a game changer

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:36.060
<v Dr. Luiz Cruz>for anyone who wants to build a business and succeed.

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:38.200
<v Nicolas Palma>Have you closed consultations with artificial intelligence or not?

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:42.060
<v Dr. Luiz Cruz>Well, with artificial intelligence, my experience is that

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:44.840
<v Dr. Luiz Cruz>on Saturday night, it's selling consultations.

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:47.980
<v Dr. Luiz Cruz>On Sunday during the day, it's selling consultations.

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:52.840
<v Dr. Luiz Cruz>And that's what I didn't have. That was my pain point, and it was solved with artificial intelligence.

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:53.700
<v Nicolas Palma>That's great.
